  "contentHtml": "<p>1. “Some crazy stats from this new JEL paper: – IV est. average 3–10x OLS (meta analysis) – Sign. results 30x more likely to be published in experimental econ (Andrews &amp; Kasy) – &lt;2% of empirical polisci report null-only findings in abstracts (Briggs et al.)” — <a href=\"https://x.com/JFiva/status/2095070676881195239\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Jon Fiva</a></p>\n<p>2. “<a href=\"https://x.com/johnarnold/status/2094876464810242134\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The UCLA athletic dept lost $52 mil last year and $83 mil in 2024 when including campus subsidy.</a>”</p>\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://x.com/zagrebbi/status/2095136923371131195\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Papua New Guinea fact of the day</a>.</p>\n<p>4. “<a href=\"https://www.sfgate.com/food/article/pho-nguyen-dishwasher-sf-22411841.php?sid=6971f3f152a4c5c4c70b3d99&amp;utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term=briefing&amp;utm_campaign=sfgt%20%7C%20the%20nightly&amp;stn=nf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Most laid-off SF tech workers aren’t qualified for this $50 dishwasher job.</a>”</p>\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://stevewilliamson.substack.com/p/whats-going-on-in-the-us-treasury?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=340317&amp;post_id=213873264&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=6g77v&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">What is going on in the US Treasuries market?</a></p>\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://x.com/andrewjkoh/status/2095219532050694372\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Mechanism design for AI alignment</a>.</p>",
